1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Frost holds the garden still.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
I lift the light toward the branches.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
The flowers are still asleep.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
You lead me to look down.

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Spring begins so small.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
You deserve warmth, too.

7
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,000
This light stays with you.

8
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:45,000
A little warmth awakens life.

9
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Spring comes softly at our feet.

10
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Spring begins right here with you.
